WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:02.530
What the hell?

00:02.530 --> 00:04.500
Why won't you do what I say?!

00:07.370 --> 00:08.840
I want...

00:08.840 --> 00:11.470
I want to become stronger.

00:11.470 --> 00:13.440
I want to become stronger!

00:14.040 --> 00:16.670
So, when do we launch our operation?

00:17.350 --> 00:20.710
As soon as we receive word from the Joker.

00:21.580 --> 00:24.210
I want you to capture the mysterious
master thief, No-Face.

00:24.750 --> 00:25.790
Give me more...

00:25.790 --> 00:27.910
Give me more enjoyment!

00:28.360 --> 00:31.330
I came here to kick your ass, No-Face!

00:32.990 --> 00:34.960
Who are you?

00:36.770 --> 00:38.560
It can't be!

00:45.840 --> 00:53.580
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:53.580 --> 01:00.540
Tooku tooi basho e to

01:13.900 --> 01:20.110
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

01:20.110 --> 01:27.070
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:27.280 --> 01:33.590
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:33.590 --> 01:40.720
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:43.160 --> 01:50.570
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:50.570 --> 01:56.540
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:56.540 --> 02:04.190
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

02:04.190 --> 02:11.060
Tooku tooi basho e to

02:17.270 --> 02:20.640
Episode 8
The Traitor’s Whereabouts

02:20.640 --> 02:21.970
Here, come on in.

02:21.970 --> 02:25.630
The place hasn't been used for years,
so it's a mess with dust.

02:27.310 --> 02:30.770
This house is plenty more than
what I need to get by.

02:32.150 --> 02:34.250
Thanks a lot, Mickey.

02:34.250 --> 02:35.580
Aw, it's nothing.

02:35.580 --> 02:37.190
Oh, have a look at the second floor too!

02:37.190 --> 02:40.550
You'll have to take the nicest room.

02:42.520 --> 02:45.730
So, this is Mickey's family's house, is it?

02:45.730 --> 02:47.060
Where's his family?

02:47.060 --> 02:49.030
Uh, well...

02:50.630 --> 02:53.070
Both his parents died in the war.

02:53.770 --> 02:55.400
I see...

02:55.400 --> 02:57.240
Dumas was a close friend of Mickey's father,

02:57.240 --> 03:01.470
and he's been taking care of Mickey,
with things the way they are.

03:31.710 --> 03:33.240
Master Robès...

03:33.240 --> 03:35.970
Master Khan is here to see you.

03:39.450 --> 03:42.420
This was delivered to my mansion.

03:46.250 --> 03:48.260
No-Face has declared

03:48.260 --> 03:53.820
that he will steal the spirit shard from that
boy who's come from another world.

03:55.760 --> 03:59.700
I do not understand what has made him
interested in the boy's shard,

03:59.700 --> 04:04.640
but I can tolerate no more of his
outrageous conduct.

04:04.640 --> 04:09.440
I want you to get to the bottom of No-Face's
scheme and capture him.

04:12.550 --> 04:14.120
Indeed...

04:14.120 --> 04:16.140
I don't know who he might be,

04:17.150 --> 04:20.610
but I do not care to be made
a fool of any more either.

04:30.270 --> 04:34.700
You must really love this to be doing it even when
you're going through a tough time personally.

04:34.700 --> 04:37.570
The soil calms my mind.

04:37.570 --> 04:41.470
The blood of my ancestors probably makes it so.

04:42.210 --> 04:43.980
That's quite a scar.

04:43.980 --> 04:45.950
This is no scar.

04:47.920 --> 04:52.690
All in my clan are born with this mark,

04:52.690 --> 04:56.650
as though we've been branded as slaves.

04:59.790 --> 05:02.700
Why, hello there! What's this, are we having
a little gardening convention?

05:02.700 --> 05:04.490
What fun!

05:07.200 --> 05:08.570
Master Robès?

05:08.570 --> 05:10.730
What are you doing here, Master Robès?

05:15.710 --> 05:18.950
I went to Dumas's house, looking for Zed,

05:18.950 --> 05:21.350
but the house was no longer there, you see.

05:22.650 --> 05:24.390
Um... No thanks!

05:24.390 --> 05:26.350
What do you want with me?

05:28.190 --> 05:32.150
The mysterious master thief, No-Face,
has announced that he will steal your spirit.

05:32.690 --> 05:34.000
What?

05:34.000 --> 05:36.460
No-Face is going to steal Zed's spirit?!

05:36.460 --> 05:38.090
Right!

05:39.170 --> 05:43.130
As the government has requested
that I apprehend No-Face, Zed,

05:44.240 --> 05:47.980
I need to keep watch on you,
but that's such a bother.

05:47.980 --> 05:50.410
So, how about this:
why don't you come to my mansion?

05:50.410 --> 05:51.610
Forget it.

05:51.610 --> 05:53.740
I'm going to capture him.

05:55.220 --> 05:58.050
I have my own circumstances to consider too.

05:58.050 --> 05:59.320
Oh, come on!

05:59.320 --> 06:01.460
After all, it's not like you have
anywhere to stay now.

06:01.460 --> 06:03.420
He does have somewhere to stay!

06:04.430 --> 06:06.550
He'll be staying at my house!

06:07.500 --> 06:09.660
Is that how it is?

06:09.660 --> 06:11.960
Well, I suppose I have no choice then.

06:16.740 --> 06:18.930
I shall stay there too.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.650
It's so small...

06:30.990 --> 06:33.020
Is this seat for sitting?

06:33.020 --> 06:35.060
Are there seats you can't sit on?!

06:35.060 --> 06:37.390
Come now, don't be mad.

06:38.830 --> 06:41.330
Dumas, fetch me some tea, would you?

06:41.330 --> 06:43.060
Some of the finest gourmet leaves would be...

06:43.060 --> 06:45.290
...impossible to get here, wouldn't they?

06:47.840 --> 06:52.140
At least, steep it thoroughly enough to
bring out what flavor you can.

07:03.750 --> 07:05.120
Teacher...

07:05.120 --> 07:06.350
Oh, I'll do it!

07:06.350 --> 07:08.820
That will be all right, young lady.

07:10.960 --> 07:13.890
I did ask Dumas to do it.

07:17.700 --> 07:22.930
Oh, and would you be a pet and go bring
some pillows from my mansion?

07:24.010 --> 07:27.340
I simply can't sleep if my pillows are changed.

07:28.640 --> 07:29.780
Mr. Robès!

07:29.780 --> 07:32.250
Teacher is not your servant!

07:43.520 --> 07:45.320
It's okay.

07:45.960 --> 07:47.590
Teacher...

07:57.100 --> 07:58.240
Now then!

07:58.240 --> 08:02.540
Let's look forward to No-Face's appearance!

08:12.050 --> 08:15.490
Hey, I was thinking about Princess Rebecca.

08:15.490 --> 08:18.590
How the heck long do you plan
to keep her like that?

08:18.590 --> 08:21.300
I say we just kill her already!

08:21.300 --> 08:23.130
What do you say, Hugh?

08:23.130 --> 08:25.330
C'mon, say something!

08:25.330 --> 08:27.470
I will not permit you to act out of line.

08:27.470 --> 08:28.670
Huh?!

08:28.670 --> 08:30.670
Quiet, Glaudio.

08:30.670 --> 08:32.300
Aw, heck...

08:33.610 --> 08:36.640
The princess will be an effective trump card

08:36.640 --> 08:39.680
in dealing with the remnants
of the old king's army.

08:39.680 --> 08:41.940
Therefore, she is still of use to us.

08:44.920 --> 08:47.260
Then let's go put the hurt on Templar!

08:47.260 --> 08:49.780
We're all set to launch an all-out assault, right?

08:50.630 --> 08:53.150
I received word from the Joker earlier.

08:54.730 --> 08:56.530
We will very soon.

09:04.470 --> 09:09.640
I thought it was some kind of joke
when you called this "dinner".

09:09.640 --> 09:11.940
To think that you were serious...

09:22.490 --> 09:24.460
Where are you going?

09:25.460 --> 09:27.430
To the bathroom.

09:59.930 --> 10:02.620
I'm afraid we can't have you going out
for a stroll whenever you please.

10:05.530 --> 10:08.340
It's no use trying to deceive me.

10:08.340 --> 10:11.570
No-Face won't show up with you guys around.

10:11.570 --> 10:15.700
Or are you No-Face after all?

10:27.760 --> 10:29.380
No-Face!

10:48.140 --> 10:50.440
Bastard, who are you?

11:13.800 --> 11:16.540
Care to reveal your true identity?

11:16.540 --> 11:19.510
Who the devil are you, No-Face?!

11:43.860 --> 11:45.660
That spirit is...

12:32.250 --> 12:34.910
So, it was you after all...

12:43.990 --> 12:46.690
Master Robès! Master Robès!

12:48.460 --> 12:49.400
Master Robès!

12:49.400 --> 12:50.860
There he is!
Master Robès!

12:53.670 --> 12:56.260
N..No-Face!

13:08.950 --> 13:10.150
Why...

13:10.150 --> 13:12.780
What am I doing in this kind of a place?!

13:17.990 --> 13:21.760
I can hardly believe Robès is No-Face.

13:21.760 --> 13:25.200
He's shard champion of Templar!

13:25.200 --> 13:26.470
I simply can't believe it!

13:26.470 --> 13:32.010
And yet, numerous stolen goods have
already been found at his mansion.

13:32.010 --> 13:33.810
Indisputable proof.

13:33.810 --> 13:39.010
The question now is whether he is Zymot's Joker.

13:39.010 --> 13:42.550
He denies such allegations.

13:42.550 --> 13:43.950
As he would.

13:43.950 --> 13:47.090
There's no chance he'd admit to being a Joker!

13:47.090 --> 13:51.590
Incidentally, has that boy's
spirit shard been found?

13:51.590 --> 13:55.230
No, Robès says he does not have it.

13:55.230 --> 13:56.630
He has it within himself.

13:56.630 --> 13:58.630
Force it out!

13:58.630 --> 13:59.930
However...

13:59.930 --> 14:01.970
It's the shard champion you'd be dealing with.

14:01.970 --> 14:03.400
It might not be so easy.

14:03.400 --> 14:06.270
Then, that leaves us with torture
as the only alternative.

14:06.270 --> 14:12.050
That would also force him to fess up
and reveal his true intentions.

14:12.050 --> 14:17.380
But that would run completely counter
to the beliefs that Templar values.

14:18.520 --> 14:20.150
You are too lenient.

14:20.150 --> 14:23.390
I was sent here from Neotopia originally.

14:23.390 --> 14:26.390
I will see to Robès's torture myself!

14:26.390 --> 14:28.400
Do you mean what you say?!

14:28.400 --> 14:33.530
But any Zymotan Joker would be a
threat to our national security.

14:33.530 --> 14:36.900
We cannot afford to waste any time.

14:41.380 --> 14:44.140
I can't believe Master Robès was No-Face.

14:44.140 --> 14:48.100
So, Zed was right in the end, huh?

15:12.640 --> 15:13.640
Damn!

15:13.640 --> 15:15.180
That bastard, No-Face.

15:15.180 --> 15:17.470
He stole my spirit shard!

15:21.220 --> 15:24.720
Look at how much people have sent you.

15:24.720 --> 15:26.810
You're quite popular, aren't you?

15:33.960 --> 15:40.490
Doesn't it make your heart ache to have
betrayed so many people?

15:42.170 --> 15:43.840
It does.

15:43.840 --> 15:50.610
My heart feels like it will split in two when I think
of these people who love and feel sorry for me.

15:51.650 --> 15:52.980
In that case...

15:52.980 --> 15:55.310
Let me out of here right this instant!

15:57.690 --> 15:59.890
I will catch your Joker!

15:59.890 --> 16:02.320
I know who the Joker is!

16:02.320 --> 16:06.530
The Council has determined that you
are indeed No-Face.

16:06.530 --> 16:08.700
Yes! I am No-Face!

16:08.700 --> 16:09.830
But...

16:09.830 --> 16:11.930
I am not this Joker!

16:11.930 --> 16:14.230
No one trusts you.

16:17.440 --> 16:19.070
Fancy that!

16:19.070 --> 16:21.680
I do not trust any of you either.

16:21.680 --> 16:24.840
I can't stand the likes of uppity
"sages" like yourselves.

16:25.480 --> 16:29.820
Tell me, Robès, what is your aim?

16:29.820 --> 16:33.220
You think I'll share that with a hated adversary?

16:33.450 --> 16:37.410
No, I suppose you wouldn't.

16:40.060 --> 16:44.260
I can't say I despise people like yourself though.

16:44.260 --> 16:47.630
Sorry, but when it comes to the elderly,
my butler is plenty enough for me.

16:50.940 --> 16:54.530
Hey, Zed! How long do you plan
to stay up there?

16:57.480 --> 17:00.810
I guess it's been a big shock to him.

17:00.810 --> 17:05.520
Well, he is totally useless without
that spirit after all.

17:05.520 --> 17:06.690
Roya!

17:06.690 --> 17:08.680
Zed, do you hear me?

17:09.720 --> 17:12.260
Come on, let's leave him alone for now.

17:12.260 --> 17:12.690
Okay?

17:12.690 --> 17:14.230
What's the deal with you?
Okay?

17:14.230 --> 17:17.400
I'm going off to the nursery.
There's still work left to do.

17:17.400 --> 17:19.030
What?!

17:27.640 --> 17:29.270
Robès...

17:30.310 --> 17:32.370
He must know something!

17:35.020 --> 17:37.780
Zed! Get back here!

17:39.650 --> 17:41.390
Let me see him!

17:41.390 --> 17:42.220
Forget it!

17:42.220 --> 17:42.860
Hey!
Forget it!

17:42.860 --> 17:43.590
Hey!
Come on!

17:43.590 --> 17:44.930
Just let me see Robès!

17:44.930 --> 17:46.830
Zed!

17:46.830 --> 17:49.000
Is he going to give up or what?!
Get out of my way, damn it!

17:49.000 --> 17:51.170
We said get lost, so get lost!

17:51.170 --> 17:53.760
Oh, you are such a moron!

17:55.040 --> 17:58.000
It's not like they'd just let you walk
on in and see him whenever!

17:59.040 --> 18:01.510
Robès! You hear me, don't you?

18:01.510 --> 18:03.710
I know you've picked up on something!

18:03.710 --> 18:05.940
Tell me, Robès!

18:07.110 --> 18:08.740
Zed...

18:13.250 --> 18:14.880
Robès!

18:16.020 --> 18:17.520
Robès!

18:17.520 --> 18:19.320
A flower?

18:25.230 --> 18:26.230
Get out here!

18:26.230 --> 18:28.200
Time for your interrogation!

18:34.010 --> 18:37.980
I wonder why Master Robès tossed
this flower out the window?

18:37.980 --> 18:39.950
What do you think, Zed?

18:44.080 --> 18:45.120
Roya!

18:45.120 --> 18:46.520
Hey, what's the matter?

18:46.520 --> 18:48.150
Hey!

18:57.530 --> 18:59.330
What is this?

18:59.970 --> 19:03.030
What the heck is going on here?

19:05.370 --> 19:07.340
This flower...

19:08.510 --> 19:10.480
Is that it?!

19:15.650 --> 19:17.280
Zed...

19:28.730 --> 19:32.220
...code 586, A-6.

19:35.070 --> 19:36.770
This is the Joker.

19:36.770 --> 19:39.070
Please come in, Hugh.

19:45.750 --> 19:47.210
I see.

19:47.210 --> 19:49.510
Then it seems the time is ripe.

19:51.850 --> 19:55.120
Now is the time for our full-scale
assault on Templar.

19:56.260 --> 19:58.820
How we have waited, Joker.

19:59.990 --> 20:01.620
Sir...

20:05.800 --> 20:08.500
Then, proceed as planned, Joker.

20:21.050 --> 20:22.050
Mickey!

20:22.050 --> 20:24.070
Hey! Hang in there!

20:28.220 --> 20:30.550
Dumas...

20:31.390 --> 20:33.020
Mickey!

20:38.230 --> 20:39.860
Dumas!

20:54.150 --> 20:56.350
What do you think you're doing?

20:56.350 --> 20:57.750
I've already told you:

20:57.750 --> 21:02.360
People should live for the things they feel matter.

21:02.360 --> 21:06.930
I merely carried through with my
convictions, that's all.

21:06.930 --> 21:08.950
So, you'll even betray people?!

21:21.880 --> 21:23.540
Move it!

21:23.540 --> 21:26.030
We'll use this opportunity to
rescue Princess Rebecca!

21:27.710 --> 21:28.980
Who are you?!

21:28.980 --> 21:30.780
Out of the way!

21:31.920 --> 21:34.350
This way, Lady Elda!

21:34.350 --> 21:35.960
You two keep guard outside.

21:35.960 --> 21:37.580
Ma'am!

21:42.200 --> 21:43.990
Princess Rebecca...

21:45.500 --> 21:47.130
I can't let you get away with this.

21:47.130 --> 21:49.100
Draw your sword, Dumas!

21:51.270 --> 21:55.230
The Gai rose has no effect on humans
from other worlds, eh?

22:01.180 --> 22:03.650
I was born into a slave race.

22:03.650 --> 22:08.960
Even as the soil soothed my soul,
I hated the blood in my veins.

22:08.960 --> 22:12.560
My hatred silently piled up.

22:12.560 --> 22:14.290
Like dirt...

22:15.300 --> 22:17.090
Like mud...

22:17.760 --> 22:22.860
I have decided that I will seize hold of
a new life with my own hands!

22:50.500 --> 22:54.370
Kimi no sono kokoro no naka o nozoite
shiritai sono kimochi to hyoujou

22:54.370 --> 22:58.270
Hitori seotta kimi no sugata kirari
hikaru namida no wake wa

22:58.270 --> 23:01.840
Kikazu ni iwazu ni okuru yo eeru
sagashiteru kotae no aida ni

23:01.840 --> 23:05.970
Kodawarisugizu kangaesugizu asu
no kimi ni komorebi kanjiru

23:07.680 --> 23:09.520
Very very much de ii kanji

23:09.520 --> 23:11.320
Very very good kimi to boku

23:11.320 --> 23:15.190
ltsudemo kimi no soba ni ite
agetai to omotterun da

23:15.190 --> 23:17.020
Very very much itsudatte

23:17.020 --> 23:18.860
Very very good kawaranai

23:18.860 --> 23:24.820
Bokura wa itsumo kibou de
chikarazuyoku saiterun da (Oh)

23:30.340 --> 23:32.810
Mayoi no naka kono yasashisa kanji

23:34.110 --> 23:36.580
Donna toki mo kimi o zutto shinji

23:37.840 --> 23:41.750
Koko ni ookiku hirogaru keshiki
buruusukai no hi no shita de

23:41.750 --> 23:45.880
li kibun ii mibun ii jibun zutto koko ni itai kibun

23:47.350 --> 23:49.160
Very very much de ii kanji

23:49.160 --> 23:50.990
Very very good kimi to boku

23:50.990 --> 23:54.800
ltsudemo kimi no soba ni ite
agetai toomotterun da

23:54.800 --> 23:56.660
Very very much itsudatte

23:56.660 --> 23:58.530
Very very good kawaranai

23:58.530 --> 24:04.490
Bokura wa itsumo kibou de
chikarazuyoku saiterun da (Oh)

24:15.850 --> 24:19.950
Next Time
After the Battle

24:17.050 --> 24:19.950


